'''Nord Atgeir''' is a [[Deep North]]-tier [[Polearms]].

* Its primary attack is a 3-stab combo with 2x damage on the last hit.
* The secondary attack is an AOE swing with a 3-meter radius that deals 1x damage and 6x stagger with no damage penalty against multiple targets.

It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding [[Cast Nord Atgeir]] and harden it in a [[Frost Foundry]]. 

== Mould ==
'''Mould: Nord Atgeir''' can be found:
* By destroying trash piles in [[Winding Tunnels]].
* In chests buried at [[Memorial Site]]s.
* By destroying weapon stands on the last floor of [[Mörkhalla]].

== Upgrading ==
Like most Deep North-tier weapons, the Nord Atgeir can be upgraded to one of the following two variants using essences:

* {{Item link|Frostfire Atgeir}} (with a [[Frostfire Essence]])
* {{Item link|Thunderblood Atgeir}} (with a [[Thunderblood Essence]])

An upgraded Nord Atgeir will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.

